OL,3,AI took Vinted to court to get my money
OL,4,Aback
OL,5,
OL,6,FMali Osmelak never imagined that
OL,7,Fselling clothes on Vinted would end
OL,8,Fwith a court claim to recover almost
OL,9,F#6,000.
OL,11,FShe started trading on the platform to
OL,12,Fearn an income while managing Crohn's
OL,13,Fdisease and caring for her
OL,14,Ffour-year-old daughter.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,112,105,200,300,0,100
