OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AI took Vinted to court to get my money
OL,4,Aback
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut when she became a professional
OL,7,Fseller in March, she was unable to
OL,8,Fcomplete Vinted's verification process,
OL,9,Fleaving thousands of pounds
OL,10,Finaccessible in her Vinted wallet.
OL,11,FAfter several weeks of trying to
OL,12,Fresolve the issue, Mali took legal
OL,13,Faction.
OL,15,FVinted says sellers may be asked to
OL,16,Fcomplete verification checks to comply
OL,17,Fwith legal and regulatory requirements
OL,18,Fand 98% of transactions are completed
OL,19,Fsmoothly without needing help from its
OL,20,Fsupport team.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
